==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Ghost Doge]]s (2,000%) spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Ghost Snache]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Ghost Baa Baa]]s spawn, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
*3 [[Zoge]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Ghost Doge]] (100%) spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Zigge]]s spawn, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
**5 [[Znache]]s spawn, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
**7 [[Zoge]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**4 [[Dashing Face]]s spawn, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is unlikely to pose a threat to anybody who has cleared [[Empire of Cats]]. The biggest threat in this stage is the four Dashing Faces along with the 3 Zigges. Cats such as [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Vaulter Cat]] should work along with 3-4 meatshields along with a heavy hitter such as [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] or a heavy-hitting uber. Any anti-zombie ubers such as [[Mighty Drednot (Uber Rare Cat)|Mighty Drednot]] can also help greatly.

